"last_modify_ts": 1794419821528}, {"comment_id": "7655250936428512040", "create_time": 1782377005, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7654224967239765290", "content": "传统文化中的“金龙巡游”\n在中国及东亚文化中，“金龙巡游”通常指节庆活动中以龙为主题的民俗表演，尤其是春节期间或重大庆典时出现的舞龙活动。\n象征意义：龙在中国文化中象征吉祥、力量与好运，金色则代表富贵与繁荣。金龙巡游寓意驱邪纳福、祈求风调雨顺。\n表现形式：多人协作舞动长长的龙形道具，配合锣鼓音乐穿梭于街道或广场，常见于春节、元宵节、庙会等场合。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "0", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA2t2tkkU2jkkmcSeGEEh_KT6UtEEjCrMsoM2PFWlEdFw", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA2t2tkkU2jkkmcSeGEEh_KT6UtEEjCrMsoM2PFWlEdFw", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "136831643", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "命比农药苦", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oQiZZPpvkxaisBMA4mbDAAYRAasIAyu3EzyPg.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419821528}, {"comment_id": "7654389730331378481", "create_time": 1782176489, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7654224967239765290", "content": "小时候去过一次广西旅游，真的很美，二十多年了，有机会一定要再去玩一次，各地的风俗不一样却都很引人入胜，值得体验，作者这个事做的意义非凡[比心]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAcuGHfzRBBttf1f7O8d3qSycHqeCAZwLGxzXkXKlZp7Q", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAcuGHfzRBBttf1f7O8d3qSycHqeCAZwLGxzXkXKlZp7Q", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "577499223", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "@小孔呀", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oomsJ4eG8Qsf7ZOBtkAwCQFEAESAfIiALAAVgg.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419821528}, {"comment_id": "7665600576977306387", "create_time": 1784786964, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7654224967239765290", "content": "这组织难度太大了，竟然成功了，了不起 [鼓掌]  [鼓掌]  [鼓掌]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAAJ9